# Rastemo (recently added)

Rastemo is **automatic**. Do not keep a hand-picked list of school ids for that section.

- A new school appears there once it is in the public catalog (`VERIFIED_SCHOOL_IDS`, not `hidden`).
- Brand city branches (`brandSchoolId`) stay off Rastemo; the brand hub card is enough.
- Do not sort `src/data/catalogAddOrder.ts`. New catalog ids may be appended at the end.
